      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grain_Valley%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city’s name reflects the region’s rich grain production and rolling plains that once fed early settlers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grain_Valley%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1991, a small group of history lovers founded the Grain Valley Historical Society to preserve the town’s past.",
